globs: **/*.tsx,**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript

- Never use return types, unless needed for some specific reason
- Always use `type`, don't use `interface`

# TanStack Router

- A URL hash that follows the scroll position (scroll-spy) or a scroll the page does itself: set it with `useReplaceUrlHash`, never `window.history.replaceState` or a plain `navigate({ hash })` — the router scrolls every new hash into view
